{"id":"n75882-1-7","stage":2,"title":"정의 · 定义","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75882-1-7-1","ko":"이 단어의 뜻을 모르겠어.","zh":"我不知道这个单词的意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단어의","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜻을","meaning":"意，意思","explanation":"뜻：意，意思；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어","zh":"单词，词汇","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3","entryId":"57287","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["다너"]},{"id":"883d841ce6a33cf7","term":"뜻","zh":"意，意思","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3","entryId":"43785","definition":"语言、文字或行为所表达的内容。","pronunciation":["뜯"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7a4f27b9e30e437b628d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75882-1-7-2","ko":"사전을 찾아보면 그 단어의 정의가 나와 있을 거야.","zh":"查一下词典，应该会有这个单词的定义。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사전을","meaning":"辞典，词典","explanation":"사전：辞典，词典；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사전","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61329","senseId":"1","lemma":"사전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아보면","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단어의","meaning":"单词，词汇","explanation":"단어：单词，词汇；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"단어","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57287","senseId":"1","lemma":"단어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정의가","meaning":"定义","explanation":"정의：定义；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정의","audio":"/audio/87c242333a3e98e4ab0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75882","senseId":"1","lemma":"정의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7b67a8962fe34d19","term":"사전","zh":"辞典，词典","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3","entryId":"61329","definition":"按一定次序将词语汇集整理以说明其发音、 含义、 词源、 用法等的书籍。","pronunciation":["사전"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"bc97e79178e9c607","term":"단어","zh":"单词，词汇","audio":"/audio/bc97e79178e9c6075345.mp3","entryId":"57287","definition":"具有一定的意义和功能、可单独被使用的最小的语言单位。","pronunciation":["다너"]},{"id":"87c242333a3e98e4","term":"정의","zh":"定义","audio":"/audio/87c242333a3e98e4ab0d.mp3","entryId":"75882","definition":"明确解释、清楚规定某句话或事物的意思；或指该意思。","pronunciation":["정ː의","정ː이"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cad1088cdb8c2ca67ac.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.447,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75882","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不知道这个单词的意思。","查一下词典，应该会有这个单词的定义。","主人家的夫人在哪里？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不知道这个单词的意思。","查一下词典，应该会有这个单词的定义。","主人家的夫人在哪里？"],"answer":1}]}
